socialism with Chinese characteristics, the spirit of the 20th National Con=
gress. But this wasn=E2=80=99t a typical speech. Hu then promised a new era=
 of taxation for the $21 trillion economy.</p><p style=3D"margin-top:24px;f=
ont-size:16px">So far, he is proving to be a man of his word.</p><p style=
